  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:16.641" end="00:19.661" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, let me see your hands to</p>
      <p begin="00:19.661" end="00:23.962" ttm:agent="v1">Bring you outside in my land</p>
      <p begin="00:23.962" end="00:28.228" ttm:agent="v1">I been with the gangsters, bandanas</p>
      <p begin="00:28.228" end="00:30.801" ttm:agent="v1">Hanging out the window, let it bang</p>
      <p begin="00:30.801" end="00:34.209" ttm:agent="v1">For the right price, they'll do ya, that's my right hand man</p>
      <p begin="00:34.209" end="00:37.590" ttm:agent="v1">We out in Shibuya, outside in Japan</p>
      <p begin="00:37.590" end="00:41.086" ttm:agent="v1">Striped sweater on me like Krueger, huh, what's it to ya?</p>
      <p begin="00:41.086" end="00:44.035" ttm:agent="v1">Introduce you to my new girl, this Ruger in my pants</p>
      <p begin="00:44.035" end="00:47.048" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, let me see your hands to</p>
      <p begin="00:47.048" end="00:51.395" ttm:agent="v1">Bring you outside in my land</p>
      <p begin="00:51.395" end="00:55.678" ttm:agent="v1">I been with the gangsters, bandanas</p>
      <p begin="00:55.678" end="00:58.267" ttm:agent="v1">Hanging out the window, let it bang</p>
      <p begin="00:58.267" end="01:01.651" ttm:agent="v1">These **** be on treason, I swear that they switch</p>
      <p begin="01:01.651" end="01:05.053" ttm:agent="v1">I just needed a reason, already dug his ditch</p>
      <p begin="01:05.053" end="01:08.251" ttm:agent="v1">They say I'm on fire, like a nineteenth century witch</p>
      <p begin="01:08.251" end="01:11.940" ttm:agent="v1">No snow on the bluff, the wire, they think I'm 50 Cent, uh</p>
      <p begin="01:11.940" end="01:16.216" ttm:agent="v1">I been hitting stains boo, you, too</p>
      <p begin="01:16.216" end="01:18.805" ttm:agent="v1">Let's be Bonnie and Clyde, **** you saying</p>
      <p begin="01:18.805" end="01:23.088" ttm:agent="v1">We gon' be like Pablo Esco'</p>
      <p begin="01:23.088" end="01:25.656" ttm:agent="v1">We don’t need no ****ing middle man</p>
      <p begin="01:25.656" end="01:28.221" ttm:agent="v1">Let me see your hands to</p>
      <p begin="01:28.221" end="01:32.521" ttm:agent="v1">Bring you outside in my land</p>
      <p begin="01:32.521" end="01:36.824" ttm:agent="v1">I been with the gangsters, bandanas</p>
      <p begin="01:36.824" end="01:39.355" ttm:agent="v1">Hanging out the window, let it bang</p>
      <p begin="01:39.355" end="01:42.754" ttm:agent="v1">For the right price, they'll do ya, that's my right hand man</p>
      <p begin="01:42.754" end="01:46.155" ttm:agent="v1">We out in Shibuya, outside in Japan</p>
      <p begin="01:46.155" end="01:49.663" ttm:agent="v1">Striped sweater on me like Krueger, huh, what's it to ya?</p>
      <p begin="01:49.663" end="01:52.626" ttm:agent="v1">Introduce you to my new girl, this Ruger in my pants</p>
      <p begin="01:52.626" end="01:55.644" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, let me see your hands to</p>
      <p begin="01:55.644" end="01:59.940" ttm:agent="v1">Bring you outside in my land</p>
